        "text": "<p>Looking to buy authentic <strong>Young LA (YoungLA) gym clothes and streetwear in India</strong> without exorbitant international courier fees, weeks of cargo clearance delays, or surprise customs tax bills at your doorstep? At <strong>Unmatched Supply</strong> (formerly Unmatched Kicks), we make shopping genuine <strong>YoungLA in India</strong> transparent, reliable, and straightforward: every piece is imported from vetted North American channels, inspected at our Khar West, Mumbai facility, billed in final Indian Rupees (INR), and dispatched Pan-India with zero hidden customs charges.</p><h3>The Rise of YoungLA: The Ultimate Bodybuilding &amp; Lifestyle Brand</h3><p>Founded in 2014 in Chatsworth, Los Angeles, California by brothers Gurmer and Robby Chopra, <strong>YoungLA</strong> has grown into the undisputed global leader in modern fitness apparel and gym streetwear. Designed specifically for athletes, bodybuilders, and fitness creators, YoungLA broke away from generic athletic wear by combining heavyweight vintage-wash cotton, exaggerated dropped-shoulder silhouettes, and tailored athletic tapers that showcase muscular physiques while providing maximum comfort during grueling workouts.</p><h3>Iconic YoungLA Collections Stocked Across India Drops</h3><ul><li><strong>Spartan Oversized Tees (YLA x Axel):</strong> The defining pump cover of modern gym culture. Built from 240+ GSM heavyweight combed cotton with a washed vintage finish, dropped shoulders, and bold graphic branding that hangs perfectly over broad shoulders and lats.</li><li><strong>Saint Heavyweight Hoodies &amp; Sweats:</strong> Crafted from ultra-dense 400+ GSM French Terry cotton, featuring a boxy, double-lined hood and sturdy ribbed cuffs that hold their shape through countless training cycles and washes.</li><li><strong>YoungLA Compression Tops &amp; Longsleeves:</strong> Engineered with high-recovery polyester-spandex stretch fabrics that hug the chest, arms, and torso for maximum muscle warmth, vascularity definition, and zero gym chafing.</li><li><strong>W405 Cargo Joggers &amp; Sweats:</strong> Featuring deep tactical zip pockets, reinforced knee stitching, and tapered ankle cuffs designed to sit cleanly above high-top sneakers and lifting shoes.</li><li><strong>Anime &amp; Pop Culture Collabs (One Piece &amp; Naruto):</strong> Officially licensed limited-edition drops featuring custom anime artwork, high-density puff prints, and collector details celebrated worldwide.</li></ul><h3>How to Choose Your YoungLA Size for an Athletic Fit</h3><ul><li><strong>For the Classic \"Pump Cover\" Oversized Look:</strong> Order true to size or size up by one size. YoungLA tees already feature dropped shoulders and an extended chest profile; sizing up delivers that exaggerated aesthetic seen across fitness creator channels.</li><li><strong>For a Fitted, Athletic Streetwear Look:</strong> If you have an athletic build and prefer a standard fit that outlines your biceps and shoulders, consider sizing down one size.</li><li><strong>Joggers &amp; Sweats Sizing:</strong> YoungLA joggers feature elasticated waistbands with durable drawstrings. Match your standard waist measurement in inches (S: 28–30, M: 31–33, L: 34–36, XL: 37–39).</li></ul><h3>Mumbai Authenticity Inspection &amp; Pan-India Courier Delivery</h3><ul><li><strong>Zero Surprise Customs Invoices:</strong> Unlike ordering from youngla.com USA where Indian customers face 42%–77% import duty plus customs broker clearance charges at delivery, Unmatched Supply stocks inventory domestically in India. The checkout price in INR is completely final.</li><li><strong>Verified at Khar West, Mumbai:</strong> Our team inspects every incoming piece for manufacturer hangtag barcodes, rubberized logo sharpness, fabric GSM, and seam stitching at Shop No 2, Kashi Kunj, Khar West, Plot No 27, 3rd Road, Mumbai 400052 before packing.</li><li><strong>Fast Dispatch Across India:</strong> We deliver Pan-India through tracked courier partners with Instant Ship options on ready inventory, and free shipping applies on orders above ₹14,999. Contact our team anytime via WhatsApp at <strong>+91 77100 96203</strong> or <a href=\"mailto:unmatchedkicks@gmail.com\">unmatchedkicks@gmail.com</a>.</li></ul><p>Explore more authentic imported activewear, streetwear, and fitness nutrition: <a href=\"/collections/youngla-instant-ship\">YoungLA Instant Ship</a>, <a href=\"/collections/gymshark\">Gymshark India</a>, <a href=\"/collections/alo-yoga\">Alo Yoga</a>, <a href=\"/collections/essentials\">Fear of God Essentials</a>, <a href=\"/collections/ghost-supplements-india\">Ghost Supplements India</a>, <a href=\"/collections/david-protein\">David Protein Bars India</a>, and <a href=\"/pages/about-us\">About Unmatched Supply</a>.</p>",
